%% Mobile app feel — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid.

flowchart TD
    trigger([A page must feel like an app on phones]) --> dummy[Draw the app view in the click dummy<br/>+ a numbered amendment, approved words]
    dummy --> approve{Owner approved the dummy?}
    approve -->|no| dummy
    approve -->|yes| snippet[Pre-paint snippet in index.html:<br/>native OR narrow + coarse pointer → data-view]

    snippet --> hook[useViewMode reads data-view once]
    hook --> split[Route selects web-*.tsx or app-*.tsx;<br/>shared words, data, components]
    split --> crawl[Prerender keeps the web view]

    crawl --> verify{390 touch = app · 1440 = web ·<br/>desktop at 390 = web responsive ·<br/>CLS ≤ 0.1 · first load not larger}
    verify -->|fails| fix[Fix, re-verify]
    fix --> verify
    verify -->|passes| done([Deploy; verify live])
